SUMMARY:Guess Who’s Coming to Dinner
DESCRIPTION:A powerful American classic returns to Asheville for a second season—bringing exceptional theater\, culture\, and community together at one of the nation’s most historic African American cultural institutions. \nPresented by Table & Mic Studios\, a subsidiary of Eagle Market Street Development Corporation\, CDC\, Guess Who’s Coming to Dinner returns with an outstanding\, seasoned professional cast for its second year performing this celebrated American classic. \nExperience an unforgettable evening at the YMI Cultural Center—the oldest African American cultural center in the United States—where history\, storytelling\, and live performance come together. \nSpecialty cocktails available\nHors d’oeuvres available for purchase\nExceptional live performances
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/guess-whos-coming-to-dinner/
LOCATION:YMI Cultural Center\, 39 S Market St\, Asheville\,\, NC\, 28801\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GuessWhosComingToDinner-scaled.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Caleb Owolabi":MAILTO:caleb080@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
