SUMMARY:Book launch "Miracle Road: The Story of Research Triangle Park"
DESCRIPTION:Join Quail Ridge Books as they welcome Mack Paul\, coauthor of Miracle Road: The Story of Research Triangle Park. This evening of nostalgia and history will explore the earliest days of Research Triangle Park\, the big personalities and big bets that made it a success\, and the calvacade of innovations it has gifted to the world. Based on more than 160 interviews with the people who lived\, worked\, and built RTP into the largest innovation park in America\, the book is a must-read for anyone who loves learning about North Carolina history.
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/book-launch-miracle-road-the-story-of-research-triangle-park/
LOCATION:Quail Ridge Bookstore\, 4209-100 Lassiter Mill Road\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27609-5882\, United States
CATEGORIES:Humanities Sector Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/launch_quailridge.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Duke University Press":MAILTO:cameron.ludwick@duke.edu
END:VEVENT
