UID:10001435-1792261800-1792278000@nchumanities.org
SUMMARY:Time Warp: Bringing Back the Funk & Groove of the 1970s
DESCRIPTION:Put on your dancing shoes and get ready to boogie \nRALEIGH\, NORTH CAROLINA (JULY 20\, 2026) – The Friends of the City of Raleigh (COR) Museum will host their popular fundraiser event known as Time Warp on Saturday\, Oct. 17\, at the Museum. \nThis year’s theme\, “Bringing Back the Funk & Groove of the 1970s\,” will take attendees back to the era of disco balls and wide lapels. The museum will be transformed into a dazzling 1970s disco experience\, so be sure to dress in your boldest bell bottoms\, sequins and platform shoes. There will be a prize for the best costume. \nTickets include a high-energy DJ to boogie to as well as casino tables\, a photo booth\, festive cocktails and mocktails\, heavy hors d’oeuvres and raffle tickets for chances to win fabulous prizes. All ticket holders will also receive a groovy swag bag as an added treat. \n“Come out and play\, sparkle and celebrate while helping preserve the future of Raleigh’s past\,” says Robyn Herndon\, director of the Friends of the City of Raleigh Museum. “This is one party you will not want to miss!” \nMuseum members can attend the event for only $50! \nThe event is held at the museum at 220 Fayetteville St. from 6:30 to 11 p.m. \nIn 2025\, the event saw more than 100 attendees. This year\, organizers expect those numbers to double. In order to secure your chance to experience this unique event\, tickets must be purchased in advance. If there are open slots available\, some walk-up tickets may be sold onsite. \nThis year’s title sponsor is Campbell University’s School of Law. \nIF YOU GO\nWhat: Time Warp 2026\nWho: City of Raleigh Museum\nWhen: Saturday\, Oct. 17\, beginning at 6:30 p.m.\nWhere: 220 Fayetteville St.\nCost: $100 for non-members; $50 for members. Get your tickets at this link. \nFor interviews or more information\, contact Lisa Snedeker at lsnedeker@campbell.edu or FriendsofCor@gmail.com or call 919-996-2220
URL:https://nchumanities.org/event/time-warp-bringing-back-the-funk-groove-of-the-1970s/
LOCATION:City of Raleigh Museum\, 220 Fayetteville Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nchumanities.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Time-Warp-2026-Instagram-Post-45.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Friends of the City of Raleigh Museum":MAILTO:cormuseum@gmail.com
GEO:35.7776508;-78.6397629
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=City of Raleigh Museum 220 Fayetteville Street Raleigh NC 27601 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=220 Fayetteville Street:geo:-78.6397629,35.7776508
END:VEVENT
